window.products.push({"id":644160,"name":"Black Toaster 4 Slice Long Slot, JEWJIO Stainless Steel Retro Bread Toaster with 1.25\" Extra Wide Slot, 6 Browning Settings, Defrost/Reheat/Cancel Fun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K8STw21AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍞【BEST RATED PRIME TOASTER 4 SLICE】 Our retro JEWJIO 4 slice black toaster is made of high-quality stainless steel, making it the perfect modern toaster for a minimalist kitchen. The space-saving long-slot toaster fits on the counter for easy storage. With the four slice long design, you can toast four slices of bread or two extra long slices for your family at the same time, making it a great choice for a home toaster. 🍞【MULTIFUNCTIONAL 4 SLICE LONG TOASTER】 The wide slot black toaster with DEFROST/ REHEAT/ CANCEL functions. NOTE: When the toaster is working, the outer surface will be very hot. Please do not touch the hot surface directly with your fingers or hands. (Tips: It is recommended to start the product at least 1 time without inserting a slice of bread before official use. ) 🍞【6 BROWNING SETTINGS BLACK TOASTER】The best rated kitchen toaster has 6 browning settings, from \"light\" (1) to \"dark\" (6), which can be adjusted by the browning regulator that controls the baking time. The baking time is the 70s to 210s, suitable for different toast needs, allowing you to make light, medium, and crispbread in a few minutes, and enjoy a delicious breakfast with family and friends. 🍞【9.5\" LONG & 1.25\" EXTRA WIDE SLOTS 】1.25\" EXREA WIDE SLOT is designed to fit a variety of bread and thicker slices, such as French Toast (Thick & Thin), Bagels, Muffins, Frozen Pancakes, and Toaster Pastries. The 9.5\" long 4 slice toaster can not only accommodate longer bread, but the long shape saves kitchen counter space and is perfectly integrated with appliances. When it's done, the bread will pop out of the toaster to prevent scalding your hands. 🍞【EASY TO CLEAN & STORAGE】We provide a 12 MONTH warranty and after-sales service. The bottom of the toaster extra wide has a sliding-out crumb tray in which all the bread crumbs are collected (the tray can be washed directly). An Anti-sticking design guarantees the 2 slices long toaster can stop toasting automatically when time is finished. There is a storage space for the power cord at the bottom side, which is easy to store. If you encounter problems, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K8STw21AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JEWJIO","source_asin":"B0B8Z3MVT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8Z3MVT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8Z3MVT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
