window.products.push({"id":644202,"name":"ZWJD Christmas Pillow Covers 16×16 Inch Set of 4 Farmhouse Christmas Deco Black and Red Buffalo Plaid Cushioncase Holiday Rustic Linen Pillow Case for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+1KfYZ6pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.CHRISTMAS DECOR FOR HOME : Our christmas pillow cover can help you change christmas decorations quickly. This christmas throw pillow cover will refresh your room, It is easy to match with other farmhouse decorations or holiday decorations. 2.TOP QUALITY: Outdoor pillow covers are made of high-quality linen fabric, comfortable & soft touch, which makes it softer and more durable, child and pet friendly,the throw pillow cases are also washable safe with machine.no bleeding, fading or fraying issue. 3.PACKAGE INCLUDES: 4 PCS Pillow Covers were christmas decor pillow covers (16x16inch 40x40cm),No Insert or Filler. To ensure the proper fit, we make all pillow covers slightly smaller (approximately 0.5\" smaller) than the insert size. Pattern is only on the front side. 4.EASY TO PUT ON: Color-coordinated hidden zipper closure brings an elegant appearance, and it’s super easy to stuff pillows/fillers into this pillow covers. 5.INDOOR AND OUTDOOR USE: Suitable for indoor and outdoor decoration in christmas, can be used in your courtyard, garden, bench, sofa, bed, car, office of any style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+1KfYZ6pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZWJD","source_asin":"B09FXGV2M4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FXGV2M4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FXGV2M4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":644203,"name":"ITWIST Long Ice Cube Trays with Lid and Bin, 4Pack Ice Cube Mold Easy Fill Transfer, 84 Pcs Stackable Ice Cube Trays No Spill,Narrow Ice Stick Trays M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nMKK+Q9lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Fill: Unlike silicone ice cube trays that can bend and deform, the covered ice cube tray is easy to fill with water. Simply add about 500ml water to the covered small ice trays with large-capacity cup or faucet , then use the lid to squeeze out excess water. You'll have 84 long ice cubes in just a few hours. No Spills: This ice cube tray is designed to prevent leaks with its multiple buckles that keep long ice trays tightly sealed. With clearly marked water lines, you'll know exactly how much water to add, and the strong plastic molds won't deform even when placed horizontally on a tabletop. Easy to Get and Transfer: Getting ice cubes out of the freezer is a breeze with the ice cube tray. Hold the cylindrical ice tray and twist the water bottle ice tray with both hands , turn it upside down, and the ice cubes will easily come out. The ice cube mold is not as sticky as silicone trays, and an instruction manual is included in the package. Stackable Ice Tray: The ITWIST stackable ice cube trays are stackable, so you can save space in your freezer while making ice cubes more efficiently. The long ice cube trays are not as soft and deformable as silicone trays, so you won't have to worry about water spilling or the stackable ice trays sticking together. Perfect Shape: With ice molds, you'll get perfect, 84 long ice cubes every time. The airtight and watertight material is not easily damaged and has weak adhesion, so you can put all 84 ice cubes in your water bottle to cool your drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nMKK+Q9lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITWIST","source_asin":"B0BRV2V3MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRV2V3MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRV2V3MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
