window.products.push({"id":644255,"name":"Syrinx Weighted Blanket Kids 5 pounds Sherpa & Minky Duvet Cover with No-Leaking Glass Beads (36''x 48'', Dark Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qWNMoqgnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Upgrate Design Philosophy】Syrinx weighted blanket with Fleece Face and Plush Sherpa reverse offers you different senses of softness to improve your sleep. Bring you ultimate softness and comfort. It’s weight could also promote your sleep. 【Double-Sided Soft Fabic】Super soft and comfortable minky/sherpa weighted blanket help you to sleep more comfortable and warm.sherpa fleece can provide the ultimate comfort.Weighted blankets will be a good companion for your sleep. 【Feel The Difference】It can bring you a healthy and comfortable sleep. When you turn over, there is no noise to ensure your deep sleep, and you wake up feeling refreshed and energetic every morning. A warm gift idea for men and women at Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. 【How To Choose Size】Based on customer feedback, we recommend that you choose a size between 7-12% of your body weight. Weighted blanket 5 lbs is intended for individuals weighing about 50 lbs. To help you make a better choice, you can refer to our size chart. 【Easy to Care】Since this is a heavy weighted blanket, We hope you can give yourself 7-15 days to get used to it.To extend the life of a weighted blanket,you could use dry-cleaning or spot-cleaning.Sherpa weighted blanket is shrink resistant and not pilling,it is easy to care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qWNMoqgnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Syrinx","source_asin":"B07RFJW9KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RFJW9KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RFJW9KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":644256,"name":"Factory-Reconditioned KitchenAid Pro Line Burr Coffee Grinder, Pearl Metallic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4139H5WAW8L._AC_.jpg","description":"The KitchenAid Pro Line Coffee Mill is made of handsome Die-Cast metal housing making for a rugged, stable, and easy to clean unit. With the Pro Line Coffee Mill, you can adjust the Commercial Quality Stainless Steel Cutting Burrs to 15 different Grind Sizes for that perfect Espresso, French Press, or cup of automatic drip. The 7 oz capacity bean hopper and coffee bin are glass to minimize the static \"cling\" of coffee grounds. The DC motor with gear reduction system makes for quiet grinding. System turns the cutting burrs at just 450 rpm, minimizing the frictional heating of the grinds and preserving coffee flavor and aroma. The Under-Cabinet design allows the unit to fit easily under wall cabinets on the countertop. The smooth metal housing is a snap to wipe clean. Bean hopper, hopper lid, and coffee bin are dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4139H5WAW8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B000IKE1TI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IKE1TI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IKE1TI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
