window.products.push({"id":644260,"name":"ICONIQ Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle, 17 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r39KOmAgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stay refreshed and hydrated all day long! With the ICONIQ Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Sports Water Bottle, your favorite drinks are always by your side and always at just the right temperature! The sleek cola bottle design is compact and convenient, 10.1\" in height, 2.8\" in diameter, and only 11 ounces in weight, with a 17 ounce (or 500 ml) capacity. It fits comfortably in the cup holder in your car, the water bottle holder on your bicycle, or the water bottle pouch on your backpack, or wherever you want it to go. The double walled stainless steel construction with vacuum-sealed cap provides long lasting insulation for both hot and cold drinks. Hot drinks stay hot for 12 hours, cold drinks stay cold for 24 hours. The double walled design also ensures no sweating or condensation. Perfectly suited for storage in your purse, gym bag, or book bag with no damp mess. Unlike plastic water bottles, the ICONIQ water bottle is crafted from 18-8 food grade stainless steel and contains absolutely no hazardous BPAs whatsoever. Bottles with our Super-grip finish should be hand was only. Each of our water bottles is built to last a lifetime and is covered by our Lifetime Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r39KOmAgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICONIQ","source_asin":"B07CHQ49QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHQ49QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHQ49QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
