window.products.push({"id":644312,"name":"Candle Warmer Lamp with 2 Bulbs, Compatible with Small & Large Jar Candles Dimmer & Height Adjustable Candle Melter Electric Vintage Candle Lamp for S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZQaUeBBOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAFE & ECO-FRIENDLY: The electric candle warmer lamp works on a 35W-50W GU10 halogen bulb melts the candle from top to bottom, so that the surface of the scented candle is evenly heated and melted, releasing a stable and continuous fragrance and making the candle burn more efficiently. No open fire means no flame, no smoke, no fumes and no pollution. Keeps your house away from fire and greatly reduces the risk of fire. EASY TO USE & CONTROL: The height of the lamp post can be freely adjusted to fit various sizes of jar candles. You can adjust the brightness of the bulb according to different needs. The brighter the light, the faster the candle melts and the stronger the fragrance. The wooden base can accommodate candles of different sizes and shapes. (Candles not included) In addition, this warming lamp can be used as a night light. (2 bulbs included) SIMPLE AND MULTIFUNCTIONAL HOME DECOR: A great choice for those who are not allowed to use open flame candles in their apartments. Wooden base with metal body and glass shade, a combination of classic and modern design, very stylish, a delicate and functional decorative lamp for living room, bedroom, study, office, yoga room, cafe, etc. It can also be used as a bedside lamp to create a hypnotic atmosphere. ELIMINATE ODORS: Candle heaters for scented candles have no \"burning\" smell and no soot, but pure fragrance, so you can choose your favorite scents to fill your home. It helps you get rid of the worst odors such as tobacco, pet urine, garbage and unpleasant bathroom smells. You can enjoy your private moments in a quiet, fragrant and sweetly elegant atmosphere. Ideal for yoga, meditation, reading and spa time. PERFECT GIFT FOR YOUR HOME: This candle warmer is a stylish, modern, sophisticated and creative candle melting lamp. It can be used as a gift to show love to your family, loved ones or friends on Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthday, New Year, housewarming or other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZQaUeBBOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELKCIP","source_asin":"B0BRPN4DYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRPN4DYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRPN4DYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
