window.products.push({"id":644336,"name":"Handheld Steam Cleaner, Steamer for Cleaning, 10 in 1 Set Furniture Steamer for Surface Cleaning, Hand Steam Cleaner for Furniture, Car Detailing, Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c55CK3bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【CONSTANT Steam Pressure】 Unlike other handheld steam cleaner that has to stop to build the pressure after every 1 or 2 minutes’ spraying(Some hand steamer may just work for 20 seconds at a time and so you have to wait and wait for it to heat up). Add 250ml water, Eave steamer can continuously steam out for about 10 minutes WITHOUT INTERVALS. Our upgraded handheld steamer for cleaning does save your time and boost your efficiency. 【Large Volume Water Tank】 Eave handheld steamer for cleaning features an extra large water tank of 450ml capacity(The recommended load capacity is within 250ml so as to leave a certain space to ensure normal use). This household steamer for cleaning allows you to focus on cleaning, instead of refilling often. Lightweight, portable, and with a long power cord(16.4ft), this small steam cleaner can go further and work distantly. 【Powerful and Efficient】 Working over 1050-1150 watts, Eave handheld steamer for cleaning can spray 105℃(221℉)high pressured steam that is really powerful to deeply clean and make things in your home “new” again with no effort. Aim this furniture steam cleaner at stain,grime, even the hard gooey spots that regular way cannot clean, it melts right off, the only thing you need to do is to gently wipe up the leftover and then done! 【10-Piece Accessory Set】 This steamer does an amazing job of cleaning. Plus 10-piece accessory kit such as: angled nozzle, bendable extension, nozzle with brush, fabric steamer tool, rubber wiper for window/door, and many other extras. It’s all-purpose and can go and clean out any hard to reach gaps, corners, angles, and also various surfaces/materials: kitchen sink, countertop, BBQ grill, toilet, floor, kids’ toy, pet mattress, car, sofa, and clothing. 【Lightweight & Portable】 Eave steam cleaner cleans by hot pressured steam which is very powerful to deeply clean the hard dirt and grease. This mini steam cleaner is lightweight, portable and comes with a super long power cord (5M/16.4FT) to go further and work distantly. Eave upgraded steamer for cleaning will help you to do cleaning with ease! Try this portable steam cleaner, you will surely appreciate such a helpful cleaning tool!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c55CK3bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eave","source_asin":"B09VBM77RH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VBM77RH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VBM77RH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
