window.products.push({"id":644366,"name":"Window Protection - Avoid Bird, Pet and People Collisions and Strikes on Window Glass - Set of 38 Stickers - Color: Translucent Dusted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nhpwr8UML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 18 flowers silhouettes of different shapes and sizes (see picture for details). The set contains 12 petals (or leaves) and 8 bees too. You can use them if you want a natural mix or use only flowers sticker. Color: . Combine several colors to create a flowery landscape. The flowers, petals and bees decals prevent bird and people strikes. Glass panels, verandah doors or bay windows can act like mirrors with the sun rays reflection. Flowers, petals and bees silhouettes are colored on both sides. So, color of the stickers is visible both from the outside as well as from the inside. However, it is advisable to apply them on the outside surface of the window to avoid mirror effect. Guaranteed high quality materials with long-lasting adhesiveness (will not fall off over time, resistant to rain, freezing weather conditions and cleaning agents) and long-lasting color (will not fade over time either). This product contains 6 sheets with 3 flowers on each sheet (18 flowers in total) + 12 petals/leaves + 8 bees. For an easier application, peel the excess vinyl off (around the flowers, petals and bees) and pull it all off the paper support sheet. After that, just peel the flowers/petals/bees off and place them on your glass with clear water. Instructions with pictures are joined to the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nhpwr8UML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"imaggge.com","source_asin":"B07V81NBQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V81NBQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V81NBQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
