window.products.push({"id":644460,"name":"Trendy Tripper FOEKJE Fleur Bubble Buddy Soap Dish with Soap Grater and Organic Vegan Soap Bars (Pistachio + 100 gm Cleaning soap)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pDHDoMmuL._AC_SL1176_.jpg","description":"Bubble Buddy Soap Dish + Soap Grater is made in the Netherlands from recycled soap bottles. Bubble Buddy promotes the use of bar soap. He can be used as a soap dish that quickly dries a bar of soap but he also has a cool grating shield. This grating mechanism can be used to make soap flakes, from bar soap, that easily dissolve in warm water. Today, we can choose from a wide range of soap bars from moisturizing body soap to shampoo bars to shaving soaps and home cleaning detergents. Foekje Fleur brand also includes organic baby soap, organic shampoo bar, general household cleaning organic bar soap and organic Rosehip with Shea Butter bar soap. This package includes 1 Bubble Buddy + 1 Bar Organic Cleaning Soap, a gentle, household, vegan soap for cleaning, doing dishes, laundry and hand lathering. Hand made with extra virgin olive and coconut oil and tea tree and citronella essential oil for extra hygiene and fresh scent. Use to lather your hands and safely clean all surfaces of your home, dishes and laundry. Use Bubble Buddy or a grater to make so soap flakes that easily dissolve in warm water for soap suds. Or make your own liquid soap by grating up the bar and cook it with 600 ml water, let it cool down, mix and store in glass jars. Safe for children and pets, no harmful ingredients. The high quality soap bars are Certified organic, Hand made, Cold processed, Natural ingredients, Biodegrable, Plastic free, VEGAN. Not tested on animals. Palm oil free. Our new soap is developed and handmade in Italy with certified organic ingredients. All bars are vegan, not containing any palm oil and obviously not tested on animals. Due to natural ingredients it makes your skin feel not clean and soft and nourished. The traditional cold process technique requires patience and steadily stirring. This gentle method leads to a higher quality of the product because the oils stay intact.The soap bars are highly concentrated and strong enough to challenge other liquid soaps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pDHDoMmuL._AC_SL1176_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trendy Tripper","source_asin":"B0852R6S4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0852R6S4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0852R6S4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
