window.products.push({"id":644537,"name":"1PC Cake Corer Plunger Cutter Decorating Pastry Divider Filler Random Cupcake","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nGBxZU2GL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Simply twist into cupcake to create a hole perfect for filling with ganache, caramel, frosting or other hidden treats. Help to get rid of the center of the cake you make as a corer. Material: Plastic. Height: Approx. 6cm, Hole diameter: 2.3cm.Use and maintenance: 1. After each use, use hot water (diluted food cleaner) or into the dishwasher to clean, do not use the abrasive cleaning agent or foam cleaning. Make sure that the silicone cup is dry before each use and storage. 2. Baking the silicone cup should be placed separately on the baking tray. Do not dry the mold, for example, for a 6-die, if only three modules are used, the other three modules must be filled with water. Otherwise it will cause the mold to be baked bad, resulting in lower service life. In order to ensure that the finished product to achieve the best baking effect, in the baking before the first layer of silica gel cup can be gently spray a small amount of anti-stick pan oil. 3. When baking is done, remove the entire baking tray from the oven and place the roasted product on the grid to be cooled until it is completely cooled! 4. Silicone cups can only be used in ovens, ovens, microwave ovens, and are strictly prohibited for direct use of gas, fire or power, and directly above the heating plate or barbecue underneath! 5. Do not use a knife or other weapon for silicone products and avoid stress, pull! 6. Because of static electricity, silicone mold is easy to stick ash, if not for a long time, it is best placed in the sun without direct paper box! 7. After the oven, please do not immediately rinse with cold water to extend the service life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nGBxZU2GL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Life","source_asin":"B0195TOAFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0195TOAFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0195TOAFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
