window.products.push({"id":644604,"name":"100% Cotton Percale Standard 2 Pillowcase 300 Thread Count Long Staple Combed Cotton, Soft & Crisp, Oeko-TEX Certified (White) - by Boston Linen Co.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EnttnztVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton HIGH QUALITY PILLOWCASES: Our cotton pillowcases are skin-friendly and ensure wonderful slumber for anyone with sensitive skin. These percale pillow cases are woven with 300 TC high-quality long-staple combed cotton yarns to give a super soft luxury feel that is exceptionally smooth, breathable, and soft to the touch. PERFECT FIT WITH EASY CARE: Cotton pillow cases standard size set of 2 measuring 20\" x 30\" have an envelope closure to keep your pillows nicely tucked away and hidden. Machine wash, No bleach, Tumble dry on low. CRAFTSMANSHIP: Boston Linen Co. manufactures 100% cotton pillow cases in-house and have complete control on every single manufacturing process of our products. Each pillowcase goes through 5 quality checks. We procure the highest quality extra-long staple combed cotton, weave it on airjet looms, and finish it on european machinery. OEKO-TEX MANUFACTURING: Woven, Processed, and Stitched in-house at our own dedicated vertically integrated manufacturing facility. This facility is CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX: an independent certification system for textiles that tests products for harmful substances. Boston Linen is the kind of company that prides itself on providing the best customer service in the industry. If you are not satisfied with your purchase at any point and for any reason, you can return it with no questions asked. Customer satisfaction is our top priority, and we mean it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EnttnztVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston Linen Company","source_asin":"B0BT9MFXS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT9MFXS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT9MFXS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":644605,"name":"Passion by The Macneil Studio, 12x19-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ljANKZ1ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a man and woman doing a dramatic dance in a sunny studio. Richard Macneil, a self taught artist, formed The Macneil Studio in 2009 with his wife Judi and their sons Daniel and Kyle. Born in Winchester, Macneil started his working life as an artist at Worcester Royal Porcelain and has always worked in the fields of sculpture, ceramics, and illustration, both in the UK and internationally. He spent many years living on the east coast of the USA, then returned to Worcestershire and freelanced as an artist and greeting card designer. Richard spends any spare time he has with his family walking in the beautiful British countryside and fishing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ljANKZ1ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0725RJQ3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0725RJQ3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0725RJQ3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
