window.products.push({"id":644663,"name":"Mini Silicone Spatula Tiny Kitchen Utensils Set of 5 Nonstick Cookware Spatula Spreader Perfect for Cooking Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o+ldguZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Size for Little Jobs】The tiny spatulas make it much easier to scoop out foods from small containers or your pets’ wet food cans. A set of small tools that can work where the larger ones won't. These tools are great for jobs like cleaning last bits out of a can, or spreading things like honey or jam from a smaller opening. 【Classic in design】 The mini spatulas work really well for all needs in the kitchen. The silicone utensil set is perfect for all kitchen prep jobs. Designed with a non-scratch silicone head and a bamboo handle.These durable balanced tools are comfortable to hold while preparing your favorite foods. The colors are lively and make them easy to choose the right one. A must-have for every home cook. 【Heat Resistant & Easy Clean】 The little utensil tool set is made of high-quality food-grade silicone which is BPA free. The silicone head is heat resistant up to temperature 230℃ or 450℉ . Hand wash with warm water and soap, silicone allows for less buildup and mess, these tools are super easy to clean. 【Widely Used】Constructed from durable silicone to protect your nonstick cookware from scratches and scrapes.Smaller size silicone spatula for cooking and stirring sauces as well as in baking, stirring in a bowl of dough or in a fry pan.The 5 piece spatula set is perfect for cake, baking, pastries, dessert, cookies, dishes. Smaller size makes it easy to carry with ring buckle and organize after use in order. The single one also has hanging holes for easy storage or hanging. 【Great Gift】 A popular silicone baking utensils in the kitchen, these baking spatulas are super cute and functional kitchen tools which is perfect gift for your friends, family or teachers. These are also perfect size for little helpers in your kitchen. Enjoy the baking time with your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o+ldguZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BSSRC","source_asin":"B08TW9WS7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TW9WS7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TW9WS7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
