window.products.push({"id":644793,"name":"Bless This Home And All Whom Enter Crystal 8 Oz Candle Hand Poured with Soy Wax/Essential Oils, Energized Crystals, Protection & Blessings Love Spell ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I0yYW6gJS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This amazing crystal candle has a variety of blessings, protection, guidance, grounding, clarity, and spiritual cleansing of all the divine energies I could conjure up from the angelic realm with the help of Archangel Michael to safely place into a candle. This candle will help clear the negative energies that are not only attached to our being, but whom ever comes to visit our home, leaving you and all who enter feeling more positive, more light, and more happiness. Crystals: Black Obsidian-believed to encourage strength, integrity, and grounding. White Moon Stone- believed to be a great healing crystal. Rose Quartz- Universal love crystal, So ripe with healing properties, drenched in harmony. Strongly attached to both heart and throat chakras. Amethyst- Amazing meditation crystal, its very presence is believed to heal the mind, and emotions. It is the stone to connect you with the Divine. Wards off evil. Tiger's Eye- Stone of protection, power to focus the mind, promoting mental clarity, assisting to resolve problems objectively and unclouded. These stones connect each other in a circle of beautiful dried flowers and herbs, which amplifies the power and energy they give out. Bless this home and all whom enter, is the ultimate blend of fruit and floral. It starts with top notes of apple, luscious peach, and ripe grapefruit that give way to beautiful middle notes of cherry blossom and hydrangea. The vanilla and hint of powder in the base balance the sweetness of the fragrance. This classic scent is an easy way to bring a sweet floral into any space. This fragrance oil is infused with natural essential oils, including orange and grapefruit. Note Profile: Top: Apple, Peach, Grapefruit Middle: Cherry Blossom, Hydrangea Base: Vanilla, Powder Size: 8 Oz","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I0yYW6gJS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0978PXBQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0978PXBQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0978PXBQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
