window.products.push({"id":644894,"name":"OQQOEE Swivel Rocker Recliner Chair - Fabric Manual Rocking Recliner Chair Wingback Design 360° Swivel Lounge Chair with Lumbar Pillow, Cup Holders, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lH8zXclYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐SWIVEL ROCKER RECLINER CHAIR: This Recliner Chair has metal base, which allows the function of gentle 360° swivel, rocking and 3 models of seating, watching TV and napping. You can use it as a recliner for parents with baby or as a swivel recliner for adults to relax. The nursery fluidly slides forward and backward so you can be comfortable as you feed your baby to sleep. ⭐STYLISH, STURDY & COMFORTABLE DESIGN: Despite its affordable price point, this fabric recliner doesn’t cut corners on comfort. After all, it makes use of dense cushions that don’t flatten, even after repeated use. With its firm seats, it can provide advanced lumbar support. This also keeps you very comfortable, whether you’re seated or reclined. ⭐ADJUSTABLE RECLINER CHAIR: Manual adjustment, according to personal needs to adjust to the comfortable state, 95°-160° range of control Angle: sitting, lying and sleeping with one handle. NOTE: The backrest will retract as the body moves. The base of the recliner chair is made of hard metal, in order to avoid scratching your floor during use, we recommend to use on the carpet. ⭐FEATURES FOR NURSERY: This Nursery Recliner has cup holders for feeding bottle when nursing or for others when relaxing. Side pockets and front pockets for wipes, clothes, blankets etc. The rocker glider doesn't make any creaking or squeaking when swiveling or rocking so that it will not disturb your baby sleeping. Extra lumbar pillow can provide better lumbar support, avoid deforming your lumbar spine. ⭐DIMENSION & CUSTOMER SERVICE: 28''(D) x 32''(W) x 41''(H). You will get 1 chair in 2 boxes, and it's very easy assembly, all parts and instruction included, no screw needed.. To cover any issues and for added peace of mind, the OQQOEE swivel chair has a one-year limited warranty. This covers damages to the reclining mechanism and wooden frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lH8zXclYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OQQOEE","source_asin":"B0C23PKD59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23PKD59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23PKD59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
