window.products.push({"id":644944,"name":"Handmade Ceramic European Covered Butter Dish With Lid | Unique White and Black Polka Dot Pottery Butter Keeper | Housewarming Gift by City to Cottage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7103vqnV4yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple but impressive reasons to buy this product: This is a quirky, ceramic, handmade butter dish which is giving a unique twist on the old-fashioned dish. Helping save the environment on butter dish at a time all our ceramic dishes are made using solar power, enabling you to have a decorative butter dish which you can leave on your kitchen counter. In this butter dish fits a 250g butter perfectly. This covered butter dish with a handle on the lid is easily accessible making it easier to spread the joy.  Individually handmade and painted butter dish is created and designed with caring hands to ensure you have high quality and individuality. Save time on the washing up with this spotty butter dish by putting it in the dishwasher, it is dishwasher and microwave safe! Show of your new fun butter dish to friends by hosting a tea party and having the best butter dish around! This square butter dish is a must have to brighten up your kitchen, the fun butter dish colours add a splash of cute colour to your kitchen. The vibrant red butter plate with red and white polka dot cover has a smooth, unbroken glossy surface. Whether you are looking for a pottery butter dish for the countryside or a designer butter dish for in the city, these pretty butter dishes fit comfortably into any kitchen from the city to cottages and all different styles from looking like a retro butter dish or just a country kitchen butter dish. Whether it is called a butter holder, butter keeper, butter container, butter crock, butter tray, butter bowl, butter storage dish, butter storage box or even a butter case, our decorative butter dish is the perfect addition to your kitchen. Our polka dot dinnerware family and other polka dot crockeries are unique gifts for all tastes. So why not add some polka dot dishes and make it a polka dot kitchen which everyone will love! Maybe place some polka dot dinnerware on the table too..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7103vqnV4yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"City to Cottage","source_asin":"B01N4B48AM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4B48AM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4B48AM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
