window.products.push({"id":644964,"name":"Not In My Backyard SS-CCP-NB0005 Galvanized Bug Insect Repellant Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcTE8W8zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Not In My Backyard is a line of all-natural products that help ensure a pleasant and safe outdoor experience for the entire family. The NIMBY line includes wristbands, clips, zappers, candles, and diffusers. Many NIMBY products use proprietary bug-repelling inserts that are made up of 100% essential oils, including geraniol, eucalyptus, and lemongrass. Not In My Backyard is safe and effective for kids and adults. Say goodbye to harsh chemicals and sticky sprays, and get back to enjoying the great outdoors!These candles will show bugs who is boss! If you're serious about keeping insects away from your outdoor gatherings, these powerful candles contain a mix of citronella, geraniol, and lemon essential oils that are more effective than products with citronella alone. Bring these candles along wherever you'll be spending time in the great outdoors to ensure buzzing bugs are kept at bay!USE: Trim Wick to 1/4 in. prior to lighting, and each time candle is to be relit. Do not allow wick trimmings to accumulate in wax pool. Place on temperature-safe surface. Never leave burning candle unattended. Remove all packaging before lighting.WARNING: Burn within sight. Keep away from things that catch fire. Keep away from Children and Pets. Container will be hot when candle is lit. This is not a toy. For decorative purposes only. Not for food use; food consumed from this vessel may be harmful. The Companion Group warrants that this is a Minimum Risk Pesticide which qualifies for exemption from EPA registration under FIFRA SEC. 25(B).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JcTE8W8zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Not In My Backyard","source_asin":"B01N12VZHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-644964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N12VZHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N12VZHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
